    <rdfs:label>Sounding Canvas</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment>A specific class of Augmented Paintings that integrate tactile interaction, embedded acoustic systems, and adaptive machine learning to negotiate sound through physical presence.</rdfs:comment>
